        "A woman was arrested after four men were stabbed in Covent Garden, a busy area of central London popular with tourists, in a suspected \"mental health related incident\", police said Wednesday.",
        "Emergency services were called to the incident around 12:30pm local time (1130 GMT).",
        "The four victims – aged 34, 39, 42, and 52 – were taken to hospital where two remained with injuries not \"believed to be life-threatening or life changing,\" the force added."
